---
import BaseLayout from '../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Legal Disclosures & Privacy Policy | AYEGROUPE"
  description="Official legal disclosures, sole proprietorship status, registered business scope, and data privacy framework for AYEGROUPE."
  lang="en"
  canonicalPath="/en/mentions-legales"
>
  <section class="bg-brand-navy py-16 text-white">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-extrabold tracking-tight mb-4">
        Legal Disclosures & Privacy Policy
      </h1>
      <p class="text-slate-300 text-sm sm:text-base">
        Mandatory statutory disclosures governing site publication, operational entity status, and data protection compliance.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-16 bg-white text-slate-700">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 space-y-12 text-sm leading-relaxed">
      
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-brand-navy mb-3">1. Publisher Identification</h2>
        <p>
          This website (accessible at <code>https://ayegroupe.com</code>) is published by:<br/>
          <strong>AYEGROUPE</strong> — Sole Proprietorship (*Entreprise Individuelle*).<br/>
          <strong>Regional Headquarters</strong>: Lomé, Republic of Togo.<br/>
          <strong>Official Contact Email</strong>: <a href="mailto:contact@ayegroupe.com" class="text-brand-blue underline">contact@ayegroupe.com</a><br/>
          <strong>Phone / WhatsApp</strong>: +228 90 00 00 00<br/>
          <strong>Publication Director</strong>: Executive Direction of AYEGROUPE.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-brand-navy mb-3">2. Statutory Scope & Registered Activities</h2>
        <p>
          AYEGROUPE is officially registered and licensed across two strategic operational divisions:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-1 mt-2 text-slate-600">
          <li><strong>IT & Software Engineering</strong>: Custom software development, enterprise architecture consulting, systems integration, computer facilities management, and deployment of proprietary SaaS solutions (including <a href="https://www.ayeprep.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-brand-blue underline">AyePrep</a> and <a href="https://www.ayejob.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-brand-blue underline">AyeJob</a>).</li>
          <li><strong>Togo Regional Hub</strong>: General Trade import and export, IT and office hardware distribution, office furniture, freight logistics, warehousing, and corporate vehicle fleet leasing in Lomé.</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="mt-2 text-xs text-slate-500">
          The full statutory nomenclature of all 38 declared business activities is available in the interactive accordion on our homepage and IT services page.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-brand-navy mb-3">3. Cloud Hosting Infrastructure</h2>
        <p>
          This digital portal is hosted on secure, high-availability global edge infrastructure provided by Vercel Inc. (440 N Barranca Ave #4133, Covina, CA 91723, USA), utilizing multi-zone redundancy and automated DDoS mitigation.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-brand-navy mb-3">4. Data Privacy & Confidentiality Standards</h2>
        <p>
          AYEGROUPE enforces strict principles of data minimization and protection:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-1.5 mt-2 text-slate-600">
          <li><strong>Purpose Limitation</strong>: Any information submitted via our direct communication forms (name, company, email, phone, project outline) is solely utilized to address your direct inquiry.</li>
          <li><strong>Zero Commercial Disclosures</strong>: No personal information is ever sold, leased, or distributed to advertising brokers.</li>
          <li><strong>Encrypted Transport</strong>: All traffic is securely transmitted utilizing standard HTTPS (TLS 1.3) cryptographic protocols.</li>
          <li><strong>User Rights</strong>: You maintain the right to review, rectify, or request deletion of any information held on file by contacting <code>contact@ayegroupe.com</code>.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-brand-navy mb-3">5. Intellectual Property</h2>
        <p>
          All trademarks, vector emblems, brand guidelines, editorial content, and interface designs contained within this portal are the intellectual property of AYEGROUPE. Any unauthorized reproduction or public redistribution without express written consent is strictly prohibited. The brands <em>AyePrep</em> and <em>AyeJob</em> are proprietary assets operated by the group.
        </p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
